==Pride Event 2024==
Pride has returned to Old School RuneScape, bringing with it a heartwarming event to enjoy. These events are our way of supporting our LGBTQIA+ players and the wider community – so wear your colours with pride as you dive in to our latest event!

Your journey begins north of '''Falador,''' where you’ll find '''Kit Breaker''' and a frankly unworkable amount of luggage. Kit has big dreams of becoming a white knight, but they need your help to get there. This year, you’ll have '''four whole weeks''' to help him discover their true calling and embrace what makes him special.

[[File:Pride 2024 (1).png|600px|center]]

Along with the fuzzy feelings of having helped someone in need, you’ll also be rewarded with a colourful new Cape and a snazzy Pride Crown Shirt. Like the other Pride rewards, you can customise them with the colours of several different Pride flags – and of course, they match the rewards from previous years!

[[File:Pride 2024 (2).png|600px|center]]

If you missed out on any of the rewards from previous years, don’t panic! As with any Old School RuneScape event, you can claim your rainbow goodies from Diango in Draynor or from Gilbert west of Varrock.

