===RuneScape Kingdoms TTRPG Coming to Free RPG Day!===
[[File:Pride 2024 (7).png|600px|center]]

If you’re interested in RuneScape Kingdoms: The Roleplaying Game but don’t know where to start, then boy do we have exciting news for you!

Our friends at Steamforged Games have announced that for this year’s Free RPG Day on June 22nd, RuneScape Kingdoms: The Roleplaying Game will be getting a free Quick Start Guide!

Free RPG Day is an annual event that takes place on June 22nd. Local gaming stores in the US and worldwide can sign up to participate, and will receive a box of special RPG content – including the RuneScape Kingdoms Quick Start Guide! Copies are limited, so if you want to get your hands on one you’ll need to enquire at your nearest participating store, which you can find [https://freerpgday.com/gamers here].

There may be RPG sessions for you to join in with, or, if you’re an experienced GM, you can even volunteer to run one yourself!

[[File:Pride 2024 (8).png|600px|center]]

The RuneScape Kingdoms Quick Start Guide includes core rules for running an adventure, a pre-written one-shot campaign with suggested player profiles, and the necessary bestiary! It’s all you need to get started with RuneScape Kingdoms: The Roleplaying Game – and if you like it, you can pick up the full core rule book, too!

RuneScape Kingdoms: The Roleplaying Game is available at your local hobby gaming store, online, or direct from [https://steamforged.com/en-eu/collections/runescape-kingdoms Steamforged Games ] and the[https://runescape.backstreetmerch.com/  Official Merch Store]. We still have copies of both the Standard and Collector’s Editions, so take your pick!

RuneScape Kingdoms: The Roleplaying game is a Tabletop Roleplaying Game. Unlike your standard board game, roleplaying games have infinite possibilities for adventure! All you need to play is the core rule book (or the Quick Start Guide!), a pen, paper, and some dice. Oh, and you’ll need to invite your most adventurous friends to play it with you!

Happy Free RPG Day, everyone – and let us know how your adventure goes!

===RuneScape: Gift of Guthix===
The first of our three original novels launched on May 14th, and the reviews are in!

[[File:Pride 2024 (9).png|600px|center]]

We’re thrilled to see how much you love The Gift of Guthix. If you read and enjoyed the novel, don’t forget to post your review and let author @erinmevans know how much you liked it!

