We’re also delighted to announce that a second novel will be published in early November! ''RuneScape: The Fall of Hallowvale ''is written by Robbie MacNiven, and tells the harrowing tale of the God Wars’ greatest conflict.

If you’re yet to get your hands on a copy of The Gift of Guthix, you can pick one up direct from our friends at[https://titanbooks.com/71617-runescape-the-gift-of-guthix/  Titan Books] , or from a number of online retailers. Find them all on[https://titanbooks.com/71616-runescape-the-fall-of-hallowvale/  this page]!

